- * 2592x1944 @ 30 fps, 12-bit linear, 2-lane.
- * Extracted from the OpenIPC ev200 driver's IMX335_linear_5M30_12bit_init()
- * (which itself carries the OpenIPC fixes). SensorReset() and the final
- * start writes (0x3000/0x3002) are issued by imx335_sensor_ctrl.c around
- * this table; the AE registers (SHR0 / GAIN_LONG / VMAX) are written by
- * imx335_default_reg_init() after it.
+ * 2592x1944 @ 30 fps, 10-bit linear, 2-lane (LANEMODE 0x3A01=1), INCK 24 MHz.
+ * Taken from the stock vendor firmware (xrscam) of a Hi3516CV610-20S + IMX335
+ * module whose sensor is wired to MIPI PHY lanes 0 and 2. SensorReset() and
+ * the start writes (0x3000/0x3002) are issued around this table by
+ * imx335_sensor_ctrl.c; the AE registers follow in imx335_default_reg_init().
+ * The array keeps its old name so the mode switch is unchanged.
  */
